---
import '../styles/global.css';
import WoodlandChrome from '../components/WoodlandChrome.astro';
import WoodlandInit from '../components/WoodlandInit.astro';
import BranchButton from '../components/BranchButton.astro';
import ShareMeta from '../components/ShareMeta.astro';
import FaviconLinks from '../components/FaviconLinks.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<WoodlandInit />
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="description" content="About Ben Hayden, a software developer creating thoughtful and dependable products for the web." />
		<ShareMeta title="About — Ben Hayden" description="Get to know Ben Hayden, the developer behind these projects." />
		<FaviconLinks />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>About — Ben Hayden</title>
	</head>
	<body class="woodland-page">
		<WoodlandChrome />
		<div class="page-shell">

			<main>
				<section class="grid min-h-[72vh] content-center gap-14 py-20 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-24 sm:py-28">
					<div>
						<h1 class="max-w-lg text-balance text-[clamp(3.5rem,7vw,7rem)] font-semibold leading-[0.9] tracking-[-0.065em] animate-in delay-1">A bit about <span class="about-emphasis">me</span>.</h1>
						<img class="mt-10 w-full max-w-lg rounded-3xl animate-in delay-2" src="/images/ben-hayden.jpg" alt="Ben Hayden outdoors in front of green trees" width="1638" height="1092" />
					</div>
					<div class="max-w-2xl space-y-7 self-center text-lg leading-8 text-muted animate-in delay-2 sm:text-xl sm:leading-9">
						<p>I grew up in Gainesville, Florida in a large family (4 siblings). My dad is a software developer and my biggest role-model; he was the one who first introduced me to coding. I was maybe 10 or so when I started cranking out a number of silly games in Visual Basic. To this day, those projects are some of my favorite things I’ve built and I wish I still had the source-code.</p>
						<p>Unfortunately, I haven't continued my game-design career, despite my countless ideas and continued desire to finish a polished game. In the meantime, I enjoy building websites and web apps using the newest technologies. It feels great to watch a new project go from just an idea to a cohesive loved product. It is equally fulfilling to see an old site take on new life and get revamped for the modern web. These are what I hope to bring to people in my work.</p>
						<p>Currently, Winston-Salem, North Carolina is my home. It's a beautiful place that spoils me with a multitude of incredible disc golf courses and a thriving Ultimate Frisbee community, two of my biggest hobbies that I grew up doing in Florida. I also dabble in tennis and have enjoyed the amazing friends I’ve made through pickleball.</p>
						<p>Above all, I value spending time with my beautiful and amazingly supportive girlfriend, Emily. I wouldn't be where I am in life without her. </p>
						<div class="about-cta"><BranchButton href="/contact/" label="Let’s work together" /></div>
					</div>
				</section>
			</main>

			<footer class="flex flex-col gap-6 border-t border-line py-9 text-sm text-muted sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
				<p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Ben Hayden</p>
				<div class="flex gap-6"><a class="nav-link" href="https://github.com/benLavavein" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a><a class="nav-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/henjiman/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></div>
			</footer>
		</div>
	</body>
</html>

<style>
  .about-emphasis { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; color: #526744; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-cta { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
    .about-cta :global(.branch-button) { margin-left: 0; }
  }
</style>
